  <p id="c-liangshu-008-xiaodaqi-wangxun:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">哀太子<persName id="c-liangshu-008-xiaodaqi-wangxun:p001:m0003" ref="rtd_v0b_nyn_A">大器</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-008-xiaodaqi-wangxun:p001:m0007" ref="rtd_v0b_nyn_A">仁宗</persName>，太宗嫡長子也。普通四年五月丁酉生。中大通四年，封宣城郡王，食邑二千戶。</p>
